    "created_at": "2016-12-05T23:08:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-05T23:08:46Z",
    "body": "In general, these \"just collapse two cases into one\" things are very confusing to read. Better than a note would be an explicit branch in the algorithm that pads with a colon if one is not present - then there's no need for a special note, as it's obvious what's going on.",
