    "created_at": "2016-12-06T02:30:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-06T02:31:04Z",
    "body": "From my understanding of the parser spec, the spec ignores extra colons when running with a *state override*, which in this case is given by the `protocol` setter:\r\n\r\n> https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#scheme-state\r\n> If *state override* is given, terminate this algorithm.\r\n\r\nIs my understanding correct?",
